          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Bridge Curse 2: The Extrication is part two of The Bridge Curse series. It's a first-person survival horror game where the player controls four characters during Wen Hua University's \"Carnival of Horror.\" What lurks around the corner is foreboding dread, a few laughs, and of course... pure fear.",
